&lt;p&gt;Preferred: background in &lt;strong&gt;service discovery, DNS, load balancing, Envoy, or related networking systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
